      "verified_by": "A1",
      "fine_trace_step": 3,
      "description": "The return value of readRawData (number of bytes actually read) is discarded. No check for short read and no memset to zero-fill the unread portion of the buffer. The fix captures the return value and zero-fills any unread portion."
